Subject: [TEST PATCH 2/2] Clock silence delivery across HDMI signal loss

Experimental alternative to upstream PR #89: also bypass the 100 ms grace
period when HDMI is unlocked and bound catch-up to the capture ring.
Applies after sc0710-audio-lifecycle.patch on the PR #89 driver pin.
GPL-2.0-or-later; hardware validation required.

